<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Insas year net up 115 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Insas year net up 115 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     48.42	   vs	  22.47</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    10.1	    vs	   7.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		433.73	   vs	 144.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 60.43	   vs	  30.14</p>
<p>    Minorities  less	0.44	   vs less    0.34</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 0.59	   vs loss    0.84</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Insas Bhd. Its businesses include trading of paper and paper products, credit and leasing and property investment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
